# Offline basemap archives are regional extracts (MBs to GBs): mounted on the hub in production and
# dropped in public/maps for `vp dev`. Any .pmtiles file, whatever it is called, is never committed.
# The fonts and sprites beside them are small, third-party and committed (public/maps/README.md).
# See docs/offline-map.md.
*.pmtiles

# Local agent scratch/planning notes (wayfinder maps, tickets): never committed
.scratch/

